                                                 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "The Granny Smith is a tip-bearing apple cultivar, which originated in Australia in 1868. The tree is thought to be a hybrid of Malus sylvestris, the European wild apple, with the North American apple Malus pumila as the polleniser."@en ;
                                                 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-8844-9165> ;
